    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d381">

                <pb facs="0499" n="383" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg383"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The French Ambassador to the
                            Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Embassy of the French Republic to the United
                                States</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-11-10">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 10, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary of State</hi>: In reply to your
                    excellency’s letter of this day’s date I hasten to confirm the oral assurances
                    which I had previously given you and to the effect that my Government agrees
                    with that of the United States to decide that the time within which the members
                    of the Commission provided by the Treaty of September 15, 1914, are to be
                    designated will be extended from July 22, 1915, to January 1, 1916.</p>
                <p>The present exchange of notes is considered by my Government as sanctioning the
                    said extension of time.</p>
                <p>Be pleased to accept, Mr. Secretary of State, the assurances of my high
                    consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jusserand</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
